// As regexp-literals-match-ropes.ts, in a program that reads what the last match left in RegExp, so that every match takes the object of its literal and leaves its traces. A RegExp literal meets subjects that are ropes: pieces cut out of a longer text and texts that were just put together, narrow and wide.
